  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758853,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1 'n' Half Year - Commodore 64\n\nRelive the intensity of World War II in *1 'n' Half Year*, a thrilling vertical-scrolling shooter for the Commodore 64! Inspired by the classic *1942*, this game plunges you into the Pacific theater as a skilled pilot commanding a Lockheed P-38 Lightning. Soar across a beautifully rendered landscape of islands, battling relentless waves of Japanese aircraft in a desperate fight for survival.\n\nExperience fast-paced, arcade-style action as you collect powerful upgrades to enhance your firepower and unleash devastating attacks. Master the defensive loop maneuver – your only lifeline against enemy fire, allowing for three crucial dodges. A strategic map displayed on the left side of the screen keeps you informed of your progress and the challenges ahead. \n\nWith limited lives, every decision counts. *1 'n' Half Year* delivers a challenging and rewarding experience, combining nostalgic gameplay with vibrant visuals and a pulse-pounding soundtrack, perfect for Commodore 64 enthusiasts and fans of classic shoot 'em ups alike. Prepare for aerial combat!"
    },
